what is going on everybody welcome back  to the cosmic wonder where we talk all  things marvel and mcu i'm your host  warren thompson and today we have our  very first look at loki season two and  some behind the scenes photos actually  start to spark some questions about what  we're exactly going to see during loki's  season 2. now there are many disney plus  shows that have had an impact on the mcu  but i don't think there's a show that's  had a bigger impact on the mcu as a  whole than loki loki explained the  multiverse to us and explained variants  and explained the multiversal war that  already happened and is going to happen  again aka secret wars it introduced the  tva but it also kind of disbanded the  tva but then created a new one under the  control of king the conqueror and left  us with quite a cliffhanger at the end  of loki season one loki finds himself  back at the tva and he goes up to his  good friend mobius who does not know who  he is the same with hunter b-15 they  actually kind of think he's a threat and  they call security so if you're  wondering what exactly is going to  happen in loki season 2 well we have a  tiny glimpse into that today so we have  set photos behind the scene set photos  of owen wilson's mobius and tom  hiddleston's loki but first let's start  off with an interesting eternals  connection in some set photos taken by  the noel theater in london we see a  bunch of movie posters one of them is of  kingo the eternal now for those of you  who watch the eternals and for those of  you who haven't spoiler alert if you  care when the eternals disbanded kingo  made himself into a famous bollywood  actor over many generations of time and  while everybody thought these actors  were played by different people the son  grandson great-grandson of the first  original actor it was all just kingo and  here we see a poster with his face on it  this implies that loki really is going  to start to explore other areas of the  mcu specifically the multiverse and  different parts of time now of course  they did this in loki's season one a  little bit but outside of the first  episode and second episode we didn't  really dive too much into any connection  with any of the other films or other  disney plush shows but it seems like for  season two that might change just a  little bit and there might be a little  bit more of a connection here now right  before we dive into the pictures of tom  hiddleston and owen wilson there are a  couple of other posters here that have  other marvel comics characters in them  specifically of zaniac and phone ranger  now most people probably don't know who  these characters are they're not super  prominent characters in marvel comics  but their characters nonetheless zaniak  first appeared in thor number 319 in  1982 and is an entity that possesses  human hosts compelling them to kill  beautiful women and it's heavily implied  that this person possessed jack the  ripper and made him do all of those  terrible things and then a movie was  made about him later the phone repairman  has a bit of a different odd story he  was a telephone repairman who gained his  powers when he was called to fix a phone  that was actually a secret prison to a  race of aliens with advanced technology  the phone broke releasing all of the  aliens from the prison but they left all  of their technology behind giving the  repairman access to all of it so we're  already getting a taste of some little  tiny easter eggs that are going to be in  loki season 2. now moving on to the set  photos of tom hiddleston's loki and owen  wilson's mobius we can actually see both  of them very dressed up here now at  first we see just loki no tva agents  around him mobius is not around him and  there's not really much context to this  however i do have some theories of what  i believe could be happening here which  we'll get to in just a bit but notice  there are actually vintage cars around  tom hiddleston now these cars could be  collectors and they could be in a modern  time however i doubt it this is a show  about the multiverse and time travel so  i'm assuming loki has gone back in time  and based off of the other movie posters  that were shown in the other photos  since they were in london we could  probably assume loki in this photo is in  london as well and these photos also  show us posters for airport 1975 and  herbie rides again and both of those  were released in 1974 so we can assume  that this takes place in 1974 whatever  scene is being shot here so we have loki  going back in time and he's dressed up  in a tuxedo but we also have other  photos of mobius also dressed up in a  tuxedo in the same scene so the question  is what exactly is going on here again  when we left off with loki season 1  mobius had no idea who loki was and he  called security to come and kind of take  loki away so what happens from there why  is loki not in a prison right now in the  tva and why are mobius and loki both in  tuxedos here well we kind of have a few  options here and i'll tell you exactly  what i think is going on but the first  option is loki has escaped is going to  some kind of formal event where he needs  to find somebody or find some important  piece of information and mobius is  simply chasing after him and they both  have to dress up in tuxedos because the  event calls for that and they need to  blend in they can't just wear their tva  jackets obviously they would stick out  now that one is a pretty straightforward  answer to what could be happening here  but the other ones aren't so  straightforward the second option is  that they are actually working together  again the only question is is this the  same mobius that loki knew before and  became friends with or has loki  convinced this new mobius that we saw at  the end of season 1 that kang the  conqueror is in charge of the tva and  he's bad and has convinced mobius to  help him defeat him now this kind of all  depends on your interpretation of the  ending of season one whether you think  mobius is the same person his memory has  simply been altered or this is actually  a variant of the mobius that we knew  kang altered everything and yes the tva  is supposed to exist outside of space  and time however the ending made it very  clear that things can change and be  altered so those could actually be  variants that we saw at the very end  which leads us to our third option the  original mobius that we met in season 1  has somehow found loki or loki has  somehow found him mobius probably still  has a temp pad which means he can travel  throughout time and space there is a  possibility that he has found loki or  loki has found him and now the two of  them are on a quest to stop king the  conqueror overthrow his rule of the  multiverse essentially now or a new  sacred timeline that he could have  created and kind of stop the multiversal  war but keep in mind loki is the person  who knows everything yes it was revealed  to mobius that he was a variant and his  eyes were open to what the tva truly was  but loki is the one who came face to  face with he who remains and he who  remains explained everything to him the  multiversal war and the fact that if it  happened again his variants were a lot  more evil than him and killing them  would essentially unleash them and start  another multiversal war now this  storyline itself is really really  exciting obviously loki season 2 is  going to really introduce us to kang the  conqueror and specifically nathaniel  richards because it all starts with  nathaniel richards that is the original  person who goes on to become king now  nathaniel richards actually exists way  into the future in which he then gets  his hands on a time travel device then  he goes back in time and continuously  just goes throughout multiple different  points in time and he goes on to conquer  a lot of these timelines which is why he  gets his name king the conqueror so i'm  betting that loki and mobius whichever  mobius this could be a new one or the  old one or the old one with a new memory  and no recollection of what happened  before which would kind of make him new  i'm betting that mobius is definitely  helping loki and the two of them are  trying to stop king the conqueror  somehow now this is supposed to come out  after ant-man and the wasp quantum mania  which makes sense because in that movie  they are going to truly introduce kang  the conqueror he's going to be the main  villain of ant-man 3 and he's also going  to be the main villain of the mcu for a  while and the events that happen in  ant-man and the wasp quantomania are  going to be huge they're going to  severely affect the mcu and it's looking  like loki season 2 could be connected in  a big way to ant-man and the wasp  quantum mania but also keep in mind that  there is going to be more than one  version of kang heck there could even be  a good version perhaps even iron lad  would show up but whatever happens it's  looking like it's going to be super  super exciting so let me know what you  think we're going to see in loki season  2. don't forget to like the video and  subscribe to stay up to date on all the  latest marvel news for live updates you  can follow me on instagram and twitter  and as always thank you all so much for  watching woof
 

